    "summary": "CoinShares CEO Jean-Marie Mognetti says AI is draining crypto, yet Nvidia and the S&P 500 are also sliding this week.\nThe post CoinShares CEO Blames AI for Bitcoin’s Slide, but AI Stocks Are Falling Too appeared first on BeInCrypto.",
